 :context
 "kotoba-lang/industry's registry carried {:id \"0143\" :name \"Raising of camels
  and camelids\" ...} at :maturity :spec, pointed at a never-created placeholder
  repo (gftdcojp/cloud-itonami-A0143). No repo existed at either the placeholder
  or the real cloud-itonami org target name (gh api 404 confirmed before any
  work began). Identity independently re-verified against a fresh clone before
  scaffolding, per this fleet's ID/name-mismatch caution."

 :scope-exclusions
 ["direct animal handling (rancher/herder's exclusive authority)"
  "veterinary treatment decisions (veterinarian/herder authority)"
  "slaughter or culling decisions (economic and ethical authority remains human)"]

 :decision
 "Implement cloud-itonami-isic-0143 with Governor, Facts, Registry, Store, Advisor,
  Phase, Operation, Sim (mirrors cloud-itonami-isic-0141/0142 module-for-module):
  - Governor (Camelid Facility Operations Governor): 6 hard checks
    (facility-not-registered, no-execution, treatment-or-slaughter-blocked,
    op-not-allowed, herd-count-invalid, fiber-yield-invalid) + 3 escalation gates
    (always-escalate health concern, cost-threshold supply orders, low confidence
    < 0.7). fiber-yield-invalid is a genuinely new independently-verified check
    for this fiber-producing (llama/alpaca) vertical, absent from 0141/0142.
  - Facts: supply categories with cost thresholds (feed/veterinary-supply/
    fiber-processing-supply/equipment), species (dromedary-camel/bactrian-camel/
    llama/alpaca), use classes (dairy/fiber/pack-animal)
  - Registry: independent pure predicates (cost-exceeds-threshold?,
    herd-count-non-positive?, fiber-yield-invalid?, confidence-below-floor?)
  - Store: Store protocol + MemStore (registered-facility lookup)
  - Advisor: Advisor protocol + MockAdvisor (4 ops, including :fiber-yield on
    :log-herd-record)
  - Phase: 0->3 rollout gate
  - Operation: composes advisor -> governor -> phase-gate (langgraph-clj wiring
    deferred, matching 0141/0142's own stub)
  - Sim: demo runner with a working -main
  - Operations: log-herd-record, schedule-veterinary-visit,
    flag-animal-health-concern, order-supplies (closed allowlist, :effect :propose)
  - Tests: 35 tests / 106 assertions (facts, governor, phase, registry, store),
    all green
  - All .cljc (portable, no JVM interop -- verified by grep + clj-kondo),
    AGPL-3.0-or-later"

 :consequences
 {:positive
  ["Camelid-raising (0143) now genuinely implemented and fully tested from a
    fresh scaffold -- no prior partial/reverted attempt existed"
   "Scope boundaries (animal handling, treatment, slaughter/culling) hardcoded in
    governor checks, not just asserted in prose"
   "Animal-welfare escalation (flag-animal-health-concern always human) is a core
    design invariant"
   "fiber-yield-invalid gives this fiber-producing vertical a genuinely distinct
    physical check beyond the 0141/0142 sibling template"
   "Portable .cljc, zero JVM-only constructs, clj-kondo 0 errors / 0 warnings"]
  :negative
  ["Real persistent store (Datomic/kotoba-server) is a follow-up (in-memory for now)"
   "langgraph-clj StateGraph wiring (real interrupt-before/checkpoint resume) is
    deferred scaffolding, matching 0141/0142's own stub status"]}

